xodus-service: mint XSTS tokens as the title (SISU device + title + user), with the title's own endpoint list.

Forza Horizon 6 showed 'Fonctionnalite indisponible - Le serveur Forza Horizon 6 n'est pas disponible'.
Its game server (gameservices.fh6.forzamotorsport.net) authenticates against the relying party
http://xboxliveauth.forzamotorsport.net/, which only the title's NSAL (title.mgt.xboxlive.com/titles/2079757188/endpoints)
names. xodus-service read only titles/default, fell back to http://xboxlive.com, and minted user-only tokens
(no title claims: the title NSAL itself answered 403 to them, 200 to the new ones).
Base: work/xodus-ferestre (no git). Build: PROTOC=<protoc> cargo build --release -p xodus-service; install as work/xodus/target/release/xodus-service.

